  - Summary of prominent modifications in PITHA compared to InfiniTime 1.16.0:
      * Custom BLE Home Assistant integration GATT service and watch UI screens
        (Lights, Switches, Thermostat, Temperatures, Bluetooth restart), plus a
        Home Assistant custom component (custom_components/pinetime)
      * Additional watch faces (Legend, Lights, Polygons) and categorized app menus
      * New apps and games: Cooking Timer (4 independent burners), Pomodoro,
        Bubble Level, Breakout, and accelerometer-controlled AI Pong
      * In-RAM state persistence for games (Twos/2048, Breakout, Pong, Dice) and
        non-disruptive hourly/30-min chimes
      * Bluetooth device allow-list filtering, 1-minute sleep return-to-watchface,
        and rendering, BLE, DSP, and accelerometer optimizations

